<div class="text guide-styles" data-units-dynamic="article" data-zaf-dynamic="article" id="guide-body" lang="en">
<div class="markup-toc-wrapper">
<button class="markup-toc-button">Show Table of Contents</button></div>Welcome to Wowhead's Best in Slot Gear list for Demonology Warlock DPS in Cataclysm Classic Phase 4. Gear in this guide is primarily obtained from Dragon Soul, Firelands, Twilight Protocol Dungeons, and Valor Points. This guide will list the recommended gear for your class and role, containing gear sourced from raids, dungeons, PvP, professions, Bind on Equip drops, and reputations.<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="best-in-slot">Best In Slot Gear for Demonology Warlock DPS Phase 4</h2>When gearing, there are many different things to consider; different talent specializations, your currently equipped gear, and your raid composition all play a key part. The biggest deciding factor of them all is Hit rating - having too much or too little Hit rating from either talents, gems, or buffs will result in you swapping in different pieces of gear or gems to reach the relevant Hit cap.<div class="box" data-level="null" style="display: block;">
<ul class="first">
<li class="fa fa-check">
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<b>Gearing Goals:</b></div></li>
<ol class="last">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Use the highest item level items in every slot to increase our <b>Intellect</b>, and <b>Secondary Stats</b>.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<b>Hit cap</b> is determined by the level of the target, with level 88 raid bosses requiring +17% chance to Hit, while level 87 trash mobs require only +6%. You should typically gear for bosses, but having a specialized setup for clearing trash may be worthwhile.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<b>Soft Haste Cap</b> are different haste levels at which different of our damage over time abilities gain an extra tick of damage. It can be worthwhile to reach said caps if you are close to them and reforge any leftover haste. See the Attribute guide for the specific haste caps depending on spell and race.</div></li></ol></ul>
