<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="gems">Gems</h4>Red, purple, and orange gems are the best for Warlocks. Warlocks will often ignore the color if the bonus is not big enough. Instead, we should fill it with a red intellect gem. Warlocks only want to use orange or purple gems to gain a powerful socket bonus or meet our hit cap. Typically, Warlocks will change their gems to gain or lose hit or haste rating. We do this to meet specific hit or haste rating caps.<br/>
<br/>Whether you want to go for a socket bonus over pure red gems will depend on the size of the bonus. A good rule is: if the socket bonus is under 20 Int or 30 of any rating stat, ignore it and gem red. Of course, this depends on your gear and stats. It would be best to <a href="https://wowsims.github.io/cata/" target="_blank">simulate</a> your character to find the best solution.<ul>
