<img alt="" class="archon-logo-inline" src="https://assets.rpglogs.com/img/archon/logo-64.svg"/> Archon</a> compiles log data from thousands of players and shows <a href="https://www.archon.gg/classic-cata/builds/demonology/warlock/raid/gear-and-tier-set/25-heroic/all-bosses" target="_blank">the most popular builds and most popular alternatives</a>. At a glance, you can see what other players have done for different types of content.<br/>
