<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="valor-points">Valor Points</h3>Due to the 1,600 <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> cap, prioritize saving your points for the best items first. Unlike previous phases, normal tier tokens will no longer be available from the valor vendor, shifting our focus to upgrading our baseline gear. Among these, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77098/nanoprecise-cape">
<img alt="Nanoprecise Cape" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_deathwingraid_d_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Nanoprecise Cape</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77088/opal-of-the-secret-order">
<img alt="Opal of the Secret Order" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_necklace_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Opal of the Secret Order</span></a> stand out as best-in-slot options, all other items have superior alternatives in raids.<br/>
