<span class="tinyicontxt">Warlord Zon'ozz</span></a> in <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=5892/dragon-soul">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Dragon Soul</span></a> and is the only ilvl 410 belt this phase, making it directly best in slot. The closest alternative is the normal version of the belt <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77255/cord-of-the-slain-champion">
