<img alt="Atiesh, Greatstaff of the Guardian" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_staff_medivh.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Atiesh, Greatstaff of the Guardian</span></a> it is locked behind a long quest chain and only a few will be able to obtain it, requiring collecting a raid boss drops, this time <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71141/eternal-ember">
